      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The article deals with the description of two clinical case reports of a rare complication following operations of aortocoronary bypass grafting, i. e., aneurysms of aortocoronary bypass grafts. The diagnosis of an aneurysm of the bypass graft was in both cases made by means of modern methods of radiodiagnosis, namely, electron-beam tomography and multislice helical computed tomography."},
